### SECTION G — Trend History Chart (Last 24 Hours)

#### [NEW] Historical trend chart per city

**What it does:**  
Add a new section: **"How has air quality changed in the last 24 hours?"**  
A line chart (using Plotly) showing the PM2.5 readings for all 5 cities over the past 24 hours from the AURN historical data — this gives the user a sense of the trend direction and context for the current reading and forecast.

